    <item>
      <title>0.1.0</title>
      <pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 16:28:33 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>2</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>release:</strong> Sign the DMG before notarizing (#10)</li>
</ul>
<h3>Build</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>app:</strong> XcodeGen project and build configuration</li>
<li><strong>release:</strong> Notarized DMG, Sparkle appcast and GitHub release</li>
<li><strong>release:</strong> Add the Sparkle public key (#8)</li>
</ul>
<h3>CI</h3>
<ul>
<li>Checks, PR title rule, auto labels and Dependabot</li>
<li>Split the PR title check from labelling</li>
<li>Bump GitHub Actions to current majors (#7)</li>
</ul>
<h3>Chore</h3>
<ul>
<li>Repository scaffolding</li>
</ul>
<h3>Documentation</h3>
<ul>
<li>Readme, security policy and agent guide</li>
<li>Support development on Ko-fi (#12)</li>
</ul>
<h3>Features</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>core:</strong> Read menu bar items through Accessibility and rank them</li>
<li><strong>bar:</strong> Mark, tray model and moving icons</li>
<li><strong>palette:</strong> Dropdown under the mark</li>
<li><strong>settings:</strong> Keyboard-first glass settings</li>
<li><strong>app:</strong> App wiring, global shortcut and updates</li>
<li><strong>landing:</strong> Landing page and update feed</li>
<li><strong>landing:</strong> Match the dropdown mock to the app and show it in the readme (#6)</li>
<li><strong>palette:</strong> Divider above the dropdown footer (#9)</li>
<li><strong>landing:</strong> Share image, structured data and sitemap (#11)</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
